<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  The follow-up drafter (#142): daily at 04:30, draft every follow-up due by the next business day (the Friday
  run covers Monday) into the Outbox, one call each to Devanshu's Claude Code seat, through the MCP tools' own code so
  every draft gets the #9 checks. He approves each one in the Outbox; the job never approves or sends. One line per
  follow-up and one summary line per run in the log.

  On as shipped ([drafter] enabled = true in outreach/followup_drafter/config.toml); false makes it print "is off" and
  exit 0, with no call and no write. The run command starts /usr/bin/caffeinate -i -w <its pid>, so the Mac stays
  awake until it ends. The claude CLI is found on PATH or at ~/.local/bin/claude.

  StartCalendarInterval (not StartInterval), so a run missed while the Mac sleeps fires on wake. A rerun is safe: only
  planned follow-ups are drafted, so a drafted one is never written again.

  It follows the deploy tool's one convention (#17, outreach/deploy/jobs.py): WorkingDirectory is the live checkout,
  the program is the checkout's venv python run as a module, and both streams go to the log. Placeholders, filled by
  the deploy tool: {{LIVE_CHECKOUT}} is the live checkout, {{LOG_PATH}} the log file. Nothing else is filled; the
  store is the default.

  Not installed by the repo, and never loaded from a worktree. Installing it goes through the deploy tool
  (python -m outreach.deploy plan, then install). To remove it:
    launchctl bootout gui/$(id -u)/com.devanshu.outreach-followup-drafter
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <key>Label</key>
  <string>com.devanshu.outreach-followup-drafter</string>
  <key>WorkingDirectory</key>
  <string>{{LIVE_CHECKOUT}}</string>
  <key>ProgramArguments</key>
  <array>
    <string>{{LIVE_CHECKOUT}}/.venv/bin/python</string>
    <string>-m</string>
    <string>outreach.followup_drafter</string>
    <string>run</string>
  </array>
  <key>StartCalendarInterval</key>
  <dict>
    <key>Hour</key>
    <integer>4</integer>
    <key>Minute</key>
    <integer>30</integer>
  </dict>
  <key>StandardOutPath</key>
  <string>{{LOG_PATH}}</string>
  <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
  <string>{{LOG_PATH}}</string>
</dict>
</plist>
